# TOEIC Vocabulary — Day52

## 1. deadline

**n. 마감 기한**

> We must finish the report before the deadline.

우리는 마감 기한 전에 보고서를 끝내야 한다.

## 2. submit

**v. 제출하다**

> Please submit the application by Friday.

금요일까지 신청서를 제출해 주세요.

## 3. extend

**v. 연장하다**

> The company agreed to extend the contract.

회사는 계약을 연장하기로 동의했다.

## 4. postpone

**v. 연기하다**

> The meeting was postponed due to bad weather.

회의는 악천후로 연기되었다.

## 5. notify

**v. 알리다, 통지하다**

> We will notify you of the results.

결과를 알려드리겠습니다.

---

## Quick Test

### Q1

Please ____ the completed form by tomorrow.

A. notify
B. submit
C. postpone
D. extend

### Q2

The event was ____ until next week.

A. postponed
B. submitted
C. notified
D. extended

### Q3

The company decided to ____ the application deadline.

A. notify
B. submit
C. extend
D. postpone

## Answers

1. **B**
2. **A**
3. **C**
